# Repository layout

This repo has three content trees. Put new files in the matching folder. Do not add PDFs, Word files, research extracts, or design notes at the repository root, and do not import research corpora into the Next.js or FastAPI trees.

| Folder | Put here | Do not put here |
|--------|----------|-----------------|
| `app/` | `frontend/`, `backend/`, Docker image extras | PDFs, legal extracts, design notes |
| `discussions/` | Architecture, API, UX, product write-ups | Runnable app code, RAG seed |
| `documents/` | Laws, PDFs, `knowledge-base/`, templates, `research/`, `sources/` | Next.js/FastAPI source |

Offline skill packs: `skills/`. Kiro spec/skills: `.kiro/` (must stay at repo root).

Runtime wiring:

- Compose file stays at repo root. Build contexts are `./app/frontend` and `./app/backend`.
- RAG seed path is `documents/knowledge-base` (volume `./documents/knowledge-base:/knowledge-base:ro`).
- Seed CLIs: from `app/backend/`, `python -m app.seed_db` and `python -m app.seed_kb`.
